# Core GNOME desktop.
# We deliberately depend on the `gnome-core` metapackage rather than pinning the
# individual apps: Debian moves apps in and out of the default GNOME set between
# releases (gnome-console, loupe, papers...), and gnome-core always resolves to
# the set that actually matches the shell version in this suite.
gnome-core
gdm3
gnome-control-center
gnome-tweaks
gnome-system-monitor
gnome-disk-utility
gnome-software
gnome-software-plugin-flatpak
flatpak
